# Cs-137 ion source preset (source identity and decay parent only).
# Physics note: Cs-137 decays to Ba-137m, which then emits the 661.7 keV gamma.
# Requires radioactive decay physics (enabled by default).

/sourceLab/output/source cs137

/gps/particle ion
/gps/ion 55 137 0 0
/gps/ene/type Mono
/gps/ene/mono 0 keV
